From: UbyHost Plan <plan@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:54:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/34] WP33: Overdue stays in the default Stays view, guest
 languages behind a switch

The Stays list opened on upcoming and current stays, so a stay whose police
deadline had passed with a guest still unfiled vanished from it once the
guests left, while the dashboard counted it as overdue. The default view now
also lists every stay the dashboard counts as overdue and unfinished.

UBYHOST_GUEST_LANGS (default en,cs) decides which guest catalogs are offered.
German, Spanish and French stay off until a native speaker has read them.
